@startuml
title Resumefolio | Protected resume and PDF retrieval
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify requested resume / selected content / PDF variant;
if (Sharing context eligible and request authorized?) then (yes)
 if (Content selected; download enabled if requested?) then (yes)
  if (Correct language / variant / rendition usable?) then (yes)
   :Deliver only permitted content under serving policy; <<#DCFCE7>>
  else (missing / stale / failed)
   :Show defined unavailable or processing outcome; <<#FEF3C7>>
  endif
 else (no)
  :Do not expose unselected or disabled material; <<#FEF3C7>>
 endif
else (no)
 :Do not disclose protected content; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
stop
legend bottom
Direct URLs follow the same resource and availability boundary.
Conceptual checks; detailed session, cache and in-flight policy pending.
Disabling access cannot remove an already downloaded copy.
endlegend
@enduml
